{"scene_id": "pt_hedda_36", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/pdtrain/scenes/pt_hedda_36.fountain", "heading": "INT. HEDDA - CONTINUOUS", "cast": [], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. HEDDA - CONTINUOUS", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "Ah--so that is why--", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "I thought probably he meant his manuscript; but now I hear he destroyed that himself.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "So I suppose it must have been his pocket-book.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, no doubt.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "And there--there he was found?", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, there.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "With a pistol in his breast-pocket, discharged.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "The ball had lodged in a vital part.", "para": 3, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 9, "kind": "action", "text": "In the breast--yes?", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 10, "kind": "action", "text": "No--in the bowels.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "[Looks up at him with an expression of loathing.] That too!", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh, what curse is it that makes everything I touch turn ludicrous and mean?", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "There is one point more, Mrs. Hedda--another disagreeable feature in the affair.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "And what is that?", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "The pistol he carried--", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "[Breathless.] Well?", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "What of it?", "para": 10, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "He must have stolen it.", "para": 11, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "[Leaps up.] Stolen it!", "para": 12, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "That is not true!", "para": 12, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "He did not steal it!", "para": 12, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "No other explanation is possible.", "para": 13, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "He must have stolen it--.", "para": 13, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "Hush!", "para": 13, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 25, "kind": "action", "text": "TESMAN and MRS. ELVSTED have risen from the table in the back- room, and come into the drawing-room.", "para": 14, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 26, "kind": "action", "text": "[With the papers in both his hands.] Hedda, dear, it is almost impossible to see under that lamp.", "para": 15, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "Think of that!", "para": 15, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, I am thinking.", "para": 16, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "Would you mind our sitting at your writing-table--eh?", "para": 17, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "If you like. [Quickly.] No, wait!", "para": 18, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "Let me clear it first!", "para": 18, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh, you needn't trouble, Hedda.", "para": 19, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 33, "kind": "action", "text": "There is plenty of room.", "para": 19, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 34, "kind": "action", "text": "No no, let me clear it, I say!", "para": 20, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 35, "kind": "action", "text": "I will take these things in and put them on the piano.", "para": 20, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 36, "kind": "action", "text": "There!", "para": 20, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "[She has drawn out an object, covered with sheet music, from under the bookcase, places several other pieces of music upon it, and carries the whole into the inner room, to the left.", "para": 21, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "TESMAN lays the scraps of paper on the writing-table, and moves the lamp there from the corner table.", "para": 21, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "He and Mrs. Elvsted sit down and proceed with their work.", "para": 21, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 40, "kind": "action", "text": "HEDDA returns.", "para": 21, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 41, "kind": "action", "text": "[Behind Mrs. Elvsted's chair, gently ruffling her hair.] Well, my sweet Thea,--how goes it with Eilert Lovborg's monument?", "para": 22, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 42, "kind": "action", "text": "[Looks dispiritedly up at her.] Oh, it will be terribly hard to put in order.", "para": 23, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 43, "kind": "action", "text": "We must manage it.", "para": 24, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 44, "kind": "action", "text": "I am determined.", "para": 24, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 45, "kind": "action", "text": "And arranging other people's papers is just the work for me.", "para": 24, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 46, "kind": "action", "text": "[HEDDA goes over to the stove, and seats herself on one of the footstools.", "para": 25, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 47, "kind": "action", "text": "BRACK stands over her, leaning on the arm-chair.", "para": 25, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 48, "kind": "action", "text": "[Whispers.] What did you say about the pistol?", "para": 26, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 49, "kind": "action", "text": "[Softly.] That he must have stolen it.", "para": 27, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 50, "kind": "action", "text": "Why stolen it?", "para": 28, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 51, "kind": "action", "text": "Because every other explanation ought to be impossible, Mrs. Hedda.", "para": 29, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 52, "kind": "action", "text": "Indeed?", "para": 30, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 53, "kind": "action", "text": "[Glances at her.] Of course Eilert Lovborg was here this morning.", "para": 31, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 54, "kind": "action", "text": "Was he not?", "para": 31, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 55, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes.", "para": 32, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 56, "kind": "action", "text": "Were you alone with him?", "para": 33, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 57, "kind": "action", "text": "Part of the time.", "para": 34, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 58, "kind": "action", "text": "Did you not leave the room whilst he was here?", "para": 35, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 59, "kind": "action", "text": "Try to recollect.", "para": 36, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 60, "kind": "action", "text": "Were you not out of the room a moment?", "para": 36, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 61, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, perhaps just a moment--out in the hall.", "para": 37, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 62, "kind": "action", "text": "And where was your pistol-case during that time?", "para": 38, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 63, "kind": "action", "text": "I had it locked up in--", "para": 39, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 64, "kind": "action", "text": "Well, Mrs. Hedda?", "para": 40, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 65, "kind": "action", "text": "The case stood there on the writing-table.", "para": 41, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 66, "kind": "action", "text": "Have you looked since, to see whether both the pistols are there?", "para": 42, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 67, "kind": "action", "text": "Well, you need not.", "para": 43, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 68, "kind": "action", "text": "I saw the pistol found in Lovborg's pocket, and I knew it at once as the one I had seen yesterday--and before, too.", "para": 43, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 69, "kind": "action", "text": "Have you it with you?", "para": 44, "sent": 0, "present": []}]}